WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,680 --> 00:00:02,580
Should I fry?

2
00:00:02,640 --> 00:00:05,080
No, if you don’t fry, then who will?

3
00:00:05,240 --> 00:00:06,400
I am fried

4
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:14,670
Brother, why are you sorry?

5
00:00:15,150 --> 00:00:16,910
After the beating, I just wanted to run and it would be fine.

6
00:00:21,060 --> 00:00:22,780
Brother, I was wrong and I will pay you.

7
00:00:22,780 --> 00:00:23,900
I'll pay whatever it takes

8
00:00:24,100 --> 00:00:25,020
I don't want money

9
00:00:25,420 --> 00:00:26,340
i want your life

10
00:00:27,220 --> 00:00:28,340
You asked someone to hit me

11
00:00:28,540 --> 00:00:29,820
You have to give me an explanation.

12
00:00:30,260 --> 00:00:31,840
It seems you don’t want to leave today

13
00:00:40,420 --> 00:00:43,100
I asked him to pay for it and he wanted to stab it himself. You all saw it.

14
00:00:43,300 --> 00:00:44,300
Female, let’s go

15
00:00:44,940 --> 00:00:52,780
Brother, don't worry. I have something to ask you. You said that the No. 1 Branch Factory was three years ago.

16
00:00:52,780 --> 00:00:54,540
Do you remember the demolition of the family house?

17
00:00:54,540 --> 00:00:58,010
Remember remember Chen Jinping

18
00:00:58,170 --> 00:01:00,050
Do you remember this name? Chen Jinping

19
00:01:00,050 --> 00:01:06,210
I, I, have no impression. I have no impression. Do you remember Chen Tufu, the butcher?

20
00:01:08,250 --> 00:01:10,090
Chen Tufu, east end, second floor

21
00:01:10,610 --> 00:01:12,010
He refused to sign for demolition

22
00:01:12,290 --> 00:01:14,530
Just bring someone to beat him, remember?

23
00:01:16,010 --> 00:01:17,490
This Chen Jinping is my father
